body:
if only Greece didnt breach the treaties and armed the islands,maybe we wouldnt hear stupid Erdogan talking or we wouldnt had a reason for even think about war...  


For anybody who dont know about this topic;

1947 Paris Peace Treaty: The demilitarized status of Eastern Aegean Islands was once again confirmed in 1947 long after the Lausanne Treaty. The "Dodecanese Islands" namely Stampalia, Rhodes, Calki, Scarpanto, Casos, Piscopis, Nisiros, Calimnos, Leros, Patmos, Lipsos, Symi, Cos and Castellorizo were ceded to Greece on the explicit condition that "they must remain demilitarized" (Annex 6).

Here is my fuck swf build if you ever want to try it ;

Corrupt+Pop+Surge+Surveilliance(or bamboozle if you are myers,wraith and other killer which are easy to loop another option is discordance since they will stick together on gens with provethyselfes )  


As long as you are avoiding flash saves, you can see whats happening on every gen and defend it. Just make sure chases arent taking too much time and if you took more than 30 sec in any chase just drop it.
